&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;４．臨時報告書&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:3pt;font-size:3pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:right;margin-left:0pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_right" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:457.6pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
